n and redeem miles on a global network of airlines.\n</p>\n<p>\nAlFursan members are also entitled to a range of offers and promotions through our exclusive partners – which include SkyTeam partner airlines, banks, hotels, car rentals and telecommunication – which add to your miles and makes AlFursan experience even more rewarding.</p>\n</div></span><!----></p><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><section class=\"card-carousel saudia-card-slider-wrapper cms-card-carousel ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"slider-title-header\"><div fxlayout=\"\" fxlayoutgap=\"10px grid\"><div fxflex=\"auto\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><h2 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"slider-title-heading ng-star-inserted\"></h2><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><div appswiper=\"\" class=\"swiper-container swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><!----><div class=\"swiper-slide ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><a class=\"card-trip card-trip-link trip-addOns ng-star-inserted\" href=\"/en-SA/loyalty/about-alfursan-program/membership-tiers-benefits\" id=\"{C154B529-5596-4BFC-8789-A0230AB7FD29}\" linktype=\"internal\" url=\"/SaudiaWebApp/home/loyalty/about-alfursan-program/membership-tiers-benefits\" target=\"_self\"><div class=\"card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"161\" height=\"120\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/SXAPages/loyalty-program/about-alfursan-program/membership-tiers-ben